.Dd November 7, 2026
.Dt SC_USAGE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm sc_usage
.Nd show the system calls of a process
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl c Ar codefile
.Op Fl e
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl s Ar seconds
.Ar pid | command | Fl E Ar path Op Ar argument ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
samples the system calls and page faults of one process, using the kernel
trace facility.
It must run as root.
Name a running process by its
.Ar pid
or
.Ar command ,
or start one with
.Fl E .
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl c Ar codefile
Read system call names from this file.
The default is
.Pa /usr/share/misc/trace.codes .
.It Fl e
Sort by the number of calls.
.It Fl l
Print lines, without redrawing the screen.
.It Fl s Ar seconds
Sample at this interval.
.It Fl E
Run the given path and arguments, and sample that.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr latency 1
